{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_title", "source_sha256": "d0e91babd134bddb7afd84785ac33a1a025c505ebe8f30a313578d2f4800fb4b", "ja": "アイドル、天海春香", "zh": "偶像，天海春香", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_synopsis", "source_sha256": "76cc39ff2fca70682121c0ca71cab16d5e26d1695751d990853a4d6270244753", "ja": "久しぶりの定期公演、プロデューサーが\nソロに『I Want』を選んだ理由がわからず\n悩む春香。しかし琴葉のアドバイスや、\nプロデューサーと話した事で意味を理解し、\n自分のすべてを見せようと決意する。", "zh": "久违的定期公演上，春香因为不明白\n制作人为何挑选《I Want》作为自己的独唱曲\n而烦恼不已。但经过琴叶的建议，\n以及与制作人的交谈，她理解了其中的意义，\n并决心展现出自己的全部。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6517ca443158ab4b33fd7d339c92f17f7bd2c16c5190843ed449d42d55ab6c0f", "ja": "（定期公演のレッスンがスタートした。\n春香のソロ曲については、まだ答えを聞いていない）", "zh": "（久违的定期公演排练开始了。\n至于春香的独唱曲，\n还没有听到答案。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f29b3cb4cf6e1b0f4c5d249a0ce87c227309cac9940e2a03a1e43b7441d0ec0d", "ja": "みんな、ここまでの流れは把握できたか？\nそれじゃ一回、通してみようか。", "zh": "大家都明白到目前为止的流程了吗？\n那么先完整地过一遍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "f64024e64aed494e1fa7b475a1bec2c5a9999d26d7d972e34f3f6d90cf72f9af", "ja": "はい、わかりましたー！\n……あれ？　春香さん、通し始まりますよー？", "zh": "好的，明白啦——！\n……咦？春香，要开始完整排练了哦——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "0f26bf5c0fadeeadcfd4467dc275400f7737067d9bd65d4f9450eaf5055226b0", "ja": "……え？　あ、ごめん！　ちょっと考えごと\nしちゃってた！　すぐ準備するね。", "zh": "……诶？啊，抱歉！刚才稍微走了\n一下神！我马上就准备好哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "240fa11051fe1400c5da90f6f296e64c06b63ca7ccfd4b35c11d2ddbdcbe3e9c", "ja": "だ、大丈夫ですか？　春香さん。\n何か、気になることでも……。", "zh": "没、没事吧？春香小姐。\n是有什么在意的事吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "4e5653bc094d489335aa009ab3ee2b34ac99bb9654f52d69909ee466304d9cd6", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫だよ！　心配かけてごめんね！", "zh": "嗯，没事的！让你担心了，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "0ef2b7395f3e9abd5c2d85628d1cfd95023c10ee58d009fa5556b027ab8da225", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。\n……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……。  \n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "34531f16d6623ce94c07807e0ee8f78db854f14a86716a80e8a9ddf79ba6001d", "ja": "……うん！　これで一通り、確認できたね。\nみんな、気になったところはない？", "zh": "……嗯！这样就大致确认过一遍了呢。\n大家有没有什么在意的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "9550bfb927b5f63fa4a093f4a658aa9bd9ac714a21614c98df80de81cc949859", "ja": "春香さん。『Harmony 4 You』の後\nなんですけど、わからないところがあって……。", "zh": "春香小姐。关于『Harmony 4 You』后面的部分，有些地方我不太明白……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "63999510258f51e0c95e92f671bdc04c7abb8065091b60a4dd50881076f3fb54", "ja": "あ、うん！\nえっと、そこはね……。", "zh": "啊，好！\n那个……那地方呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "21dfff83735d53a2f855233a3d8f46eb1f90922b1a152a0853f7155c5b6ad32a", "ja": "春香さん、やっぱり\nちょっと元気がない気がします……。", "zh": "春香小姐，我还是觉得\n她好像有点没精神……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "ac268bfa354db38639be719616489a4697418eca60b12441a6ee121801b149b2", "ja": "う、うん……なんだか、そんな感じがするよね……\nソロ曲のことで、悩んでるのかな……？", "zh": "嗯、嗯……总觉得，好像确实是这样……\n她是不是在为个人曲的事烦恼呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4ba1c45731c75b0544bc3a093097871d3b6fe1862afad66ffba903abf6732d37", "ja": "（悩んでいても、みんなをしっかり気にかけて、\nレッスンを進めてくれる）", "zh": "（即使自己烦恼着，也依然认真关心大家，带着大家进行练习）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1014_p", "source_sha256": "3e6877d55d3f7c51aa4ac3fe2dc41ba5699bddc8d96b9e336623965a570c9df2", "ja": "（こういうところは、いつもの春香だ。\nけど……）", "zh": "这种时候的春香，和平时一样。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "1b2f31a31644e37a1b8776da6eee74d3ca83d9c53f4389bae13d95671528a993", "ja": "なるほど……とてもよくわかりました！\n春香さん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "原来如此……我完全明白了！\n春香，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "a1f47f3f2d6cf529fcc492c32ec4ac9f90361876824800ad080f8a508aa8f9b6", "ja": "どういたしまして！\nみんなは、大丈夫かな？", "zh": "不用客气！\n大家还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "d1e53cb82534838758424545a7de8dadbd37c73bc71e2e06bccddf4f7e463171", "ja": "私は、大丈夫ですー！　可憐さんは？", "zh": "我没事——！可怜呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "b07b36eedf00d791e800afdca1da7826c59184ce8a74384784d325cab03476dd", "ja": "わ、私も、大丈夫です。", "zh": "我、我也没事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "654cbbbb80537c6f3d93b7d284216fb3a2be6ca08a9aee2ac6a43809f0eb5fca", "ja": "それじゃ、もう一回今のところやってみようか？\n{$P$}さん、いいですか？", "zh": "那么，再把刚才的部分练习一次吧？\n{$P$}先生，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1020_p", "source_sha256": "77c3ea1a9210f4d03e24ae41c38db86065df6e9bd6956e52b4faef125341bc30", "ja": "ああ。それじゃ、始めてくれ！", "zh": "嗯。那就开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b", "ja": "ふぅ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "26d081ea0df5e2e7e003a9547972fce61d8f9b70547a3959da5fb6b9b14c46e9", "ja": "春香ちゃん、お疲れさま。\nここにいたんだね。", "zh": "春香，辛苦了。\n原来你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "bc6f6321dc67216f14a601597c938132f132d5f83aaf6dfacc2cba4ba35251b6", "ja": "あれ……琴葉ちゃん？\nどうかしたの？", "zh": "咦……琴叶？\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "efd5035edf6529d8012295b31adbfe22bec30737f58282b5cca965e94bdda75f", "ja": "うん。……春香ちゃんが\n悩んでるみたいだったから、気になって。", "zh": "嗯。……因为春香看起来\n好像很苦恼的样子，我有点放心不下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1026_001har", "source_sha256": "0b94bb8f5c24f045e3a7415180841949d965039c4e235ebe99fbf8d6f56efc8e", "ja": "あっ……そ、そっか。ごめんね。\nなんだか心配かけちゃって……。", "zh": "啊……这、这样啊。对不起。\n好像让你担心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "b2622175f63556f4cc034980e32468fae406588b9c785bc265752aff98da08fb", "ja": "ううん、それはいいの。\nむしろ、もっと頼って欲しいかな。私たちのこと。", "zh": "不会，没事的。\n倒不如说，我更希望春香你能依靠一下我们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "bdf67a7dcb6dfd54f1b0b7212b7a855e581ed2ad2fc44c79b5e6dab2c44276a0", "ja": "私は、アイドルとしては春香ちゃんの後輩だし。\nまだ頼りないかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "作为偶像，我是春香的后辈。\n可能还很不可靠……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "0865e67d3d4c1927b26c1ba354752b327f8220d1c9e7e3dd45bc79b934ada377", "ja": "そ、そんな！\n頼りないなんてこと、全然ないよ。", "zh": "没、没这回事！\n你一点都不靠不住。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "9e8b5b09304d13ed4ad834923b67c7198ac3364048f23aef2a1f8cf1e43293be", "ja": "本当？　よかった。\nじゃあ、改めて言うけど……。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了。\n那我再重新说一遍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "9cca8976ca2215b2754357f74dc46945c7bae36b9061a1f275f16c45704e6d6a", "ja": "何か悩みがあるなら、相談してほしいな。\nみんなも心配してるよ。", "zh": "如果有什么烦恼，希望你能来找我商量。\n大家也都很担心你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "70f3383afe971b9c1b3060c40a32cb7dc32e90acf4f7fa1461ddbb68ab596edb", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん……。", "zh": "琴叶……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "dc3c1e2c437624589dd408c0f712d583a7af85cfc47a1ec3ba31efdc3444eeda", "ja": "……うん、えへへ、そうだね。\n私ってば、ひとりで考えこんじゃってたみたい。", "zh": "……嗯，嘿嘿，是啊。\n我好像不知不觉一个人想得太多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "1b6359938a4a713ed467fa43b0a1f3e4bff40088edbf73e20d63dd18e9a75a98", "ja": "えっと……聞いてもらっても、いいかな？\n次の公演で歌う、ソロ曲のことなんだけど……。", "zh": "那个……可以听我说说吗？\n是关于下次公演要唱的独唱曲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "10247cf61ff834c05dd2b1343eb938d82bdcb71b3b1819e4ee1d3b4fcc6fa1d7", "ja": "{$P$}から\n提案された曲、やっぱり迷ってる？", "zh": "你还是在犹豫要不要唱{$P$}提议的那首歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1036_001har", "source_sha256": "401ee8d61be9e168395c235a72d4bd46308c00a4382d408ddfe48abe9da3ed10", "ja": "うん。『I Want』は大切な曲だし、思い入れも\nあって、歌いたいって気持ちはすごくあるんだ。", "zh": "嗯。《I Want》是对我来说很重要的歌，也有着特别的回忆，我真的很想唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1037_001har", "source_sha256": "bb040f57f533e651f08ae876f8b6a092f6b798aaa04757299368eee3be242ae4", "ja": "でも、他の曲と比べると、尖ってるっていうか……\n普段の私のイメージとは、違うかなって。", "zh": "不过，和其他歌曲相比，这首歌更为尖锐……或者说，感觉和我平时的形象不太一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "a0f4e3fcba54b7b56d6cf5c34ea417f0245cb463bef71c7ca30efcb36ed5a2a1", "ja": "普段の春香ちゃんだと……\n『明るい』とか、『元気』、かな？", "zh": "平时的春香的话……\n是『开朗』啊，还有『有活力』，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1039_017kth", "source_sha256": "34f960c97ba8b2b03ec1d282bd3f6e80dcbd8e8458beb89b1d0881193fb47650", "ja": "私たちは、『優しい』もあると思ってるけど。\n……どっちにしろ、だいぶイメージが違うよね。", "zh": "我觉得我们还会想到\"温柔\"这个词呢。\n……不管怎样，和平时的印象差挺多的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1040_001har", "source_sha256": "10dc7e22e69b4a42d0d057f11f8f4eb4d5b92f93c7309cf03bae581eea9a1804", "ja": "うん。ずっと応援してくれてるファンのみんなは、\nそういう挑戦も受け止めてくれると思うんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。一直支持我的粉丝们，\n应该也会欣然接受这样的挑战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1041_001har", "source_sha256": "d633fcb77d9e68a857ef85bf9c71c0cc2112af4150208bf837a50c306c19d673", "ja": "今回は、初めてのお客さんもいるから。この曲で、\nアイドルとしての私の魅力を届けられるのかな？って。", "zh": "因为这次也有第一次来看演出的客人。用这首歌，真的能传达出我作为偶像的魅力吗？我有点担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1042_001har", "source_sha256": "8a0962fb86e35dff93f360ce6d7c047de5548d3db4219cbf2e2aa8f1a449a097", "ja": "みんな、ビックリしちゃわないかな？って、\nちょっと心配で……。", "zh": "会不会吓大家一跳呢？\n我有点担心这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "d08bc1ac6c5318505af85334a10d1f8ea6fafa764a31c06dc0b7ce8acb74e977", "ja": "うーん……たしかに、春香ちゃんの気持ちもわかるな。\n私も、同じ立場だったら悩むだろうし……。", "zh": "嗯……确实，我也能理解春香的心情。\n如果换作是我处在同样的立场，应该也会很苦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1044_001har", "source_sha256": "fc8572e809283533d49d0cb5b949dc6d2eae26b36e28e0ff8dc813bdcbb501fc", "ja": "もし、琴葉ちゃんだったら……\nこういう時、どうする？", "zh": "要是琴叶的话……\n这种时候会怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "eedb186e83780db46d200b119ef3febb12b2203a4a1c134b7887cb2514bcf8a6", "ja": "そうだね。お客さんが、春香ちゃんに\nどんなものを求めているかにもよると思うけど……。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得，这也要看观众希望春香展现什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "7c66ae5b07942a732d2669570362140ce307f9c1d7504d024c78c7923f3cadec", "ja": "でも私は、歌でも、お芝居でも……\nそこにある本気って、伝わると思うから。", "zh": "不过我觉得，无论是唱歌，还是演戏……只要是真心投入的努力，就一定能传达给大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1047_001har", "source_sha256": "f62201156a1aa64e4f6eece19f13caaaf6cf2e2fa6eb047d7aedf15478c582e3", "ja": "本気……？", "zh": "认真……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1048_017kth", "source_sha256": "83753475340f6db658e7c1e102bee4a5cc978346afc40e598f00b57c8b882848", "ja": "そう。本気。", "zh": "嗯，认真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1049_001har", "source_sha256": "2e36e628313e416d9926e7396db5117a76eb5d5fcd8bb9ad2ffefead87cde27a", "ja": "……。{$P$}さんは、\nどうしてこの曲を選んだのかな……。", "zh": "……。{$P$}先生，\n为什么会选了这首歌呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1050_001har", "source_sha256": "6b016ee53b19f8bfab80492ee77d93aabb89c84b1dcb43daf459d0390c8a6ef7", "ja": "私、「考えてみてほしい」って言われたのに。\n自分の曲なのに、ちっともわからなくて……。", "zh": "我明明被说\"希望你好好想想\"。\n可这明明是我自己的曲子，却完全不明白……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1051_017kth", "source_sha256": "62958d39f1d641ac7c135bd949e1c00a039ebe90f6b5c7ced1a15460c634d7f7", "ja": "わからないなら、聞いてもいいんじゃないかな？\n{$P$}に。", "zh": "如果想不明白，去问问看也没关系吧？\n问问{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1052_001har", "source_sha256": "d2e4894b8bc2b9bc9ac82eb7736f62772ea71eaf0ad798613b9d1dba2401006d", "ja": "……。聞いても、いいのかな。\n考えたけど、わからないんです、って。", "zh": "……。真的可以问吗？\n问他说，虽然思考过了，但还是不明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1053_001har", "source_sha256": "aac534768d15a19049efcd4c4fb8cf037ff99e927cf59795a1c1af0d50c7e510", "ja": "聞いてみても、いいのかな。\n{$P$}さんに……。", "zh": "我可以试着问问吗？\n问问{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1054_001har", "source_sha256": "a17eed3591d1df9a9d6bb853edac8b8aeb5a20d011f4a3f6c820adc74eb6b42f", "ja": "どうしてこの曲を選んだんですか、って。", "zh": "就问“为什么选择这首歌呢？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1055_017kth", "source_sha256": "ebfa5ea2dea975e0f3f0135043b93c710c849553d19ea717525a06e881be7222", "ja": "いいんじゃないかな。\n……がんばってね、春香ちゃん。", "zh": "这样不是挺好的吗？\n……加油，春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1056_001har", "source_sha256": "63946e0313e43b7870bd19c9bbf99424ccecb21f398fb0be38d6f0565bcd63ac", "ja": "うん。……ありがとう、琴葉ちゃん。", "zh": "嗯。……谢谢你，琴叶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1058_001har", "source_sha256": "006e389793d55202c324950d7982bbbffa5709539049114bcb7df73857ac534e", "ja": "『{$P$}さん、相談したいことが\nあります。明日、時間をください』", "zh": "『{$P$}先生，我有事想找您\n商量。明天能抽空见一面吗』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1059_p", "source_sha256": "cb63dd323de857a614b3a8cb5241241999132722cf62c5cce595f2ca1c9acc0d", "ja": "（春香から、メールが来た。\nきっと、定期公演のソロ曲の事だろう）", "zh": "（春香给我发来了邮件。\n肯定是关于定期公演的个人曲吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1060_p", "source_sha256": "b8869e177e4d5d65c40ccaa26c4f95a661264bfe356d5f6db58f4d8ee011b618", "ja": "（無理を言っているのかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（或许是我提出了过分的要求……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1061_p", "source_sha256": "fc9225c0d88585bd8d9f350760c2a971f187931eb72dfdee0d3fff34d0c61c0f", "ja": "『俺もちょうど話したい事があった。\n明日、レッスンが始まる前に事務室に来てくれ』", "zh": "我也正好有件事想和你谈谈。\n明天课程开始前，来一趟办公室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1062_001har", "source_sha256": "f4af0102550da55ef619268ca19cd9d22d6dcb43321181bc542f922711d4c539", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん。\nすみません、時間作ってもらっちゃって。", "zh": "早上好，{$P$}先生。不好意思，还特意让您抽出时间来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1063_p", "source_sha256": "7225fa1e7ad6356e1ec5b13992763d73429ec2befb151641bf64176a81d6242a", "ja": "おはよう、春香。ちょうど連絡しようと\n思ってたところだったから、大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "早上好，春香。我正好也想联系你来着，没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1064_001har", "source_sha256": "28b0a5a88900c74b542e5811d7d0c16273ae4b6133cd8083a97f41bede78deb1", "ja": "えっ、そうだったんですか？\nあの、{$P$}さんのお話って……。", "zh": "咦，原来是这样吗？\n那个，关于{$P$}先生的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1065_p", "source_sha256": "cd84e83671fec5fb136a47722c7b41a200cdbbcd20df2b7e6f4186d5477fac4a", "ja": "その前に、春香の話からだな。\n……やっぱり、ソロ曲の事か？", "zh": "在那之前，先从春香的事说起吧。\n……果然，是在说独唱曲的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1066_001har", "source_sha256": "f5acc76a520eab86a2b61a6035ac18395279ba0d2d51abb1ab13dd3e7d39497e", "ja": "は、はい。……あの。他にも、色んな曲があるのに\n……どうして、『I Want』を選んだんですか？", "zh": "是、是的。……那个。明明还有各种各样的歌……\n……为什么选择了《I Want》呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1067_001har", "source_sha256": "6f47e4c98819fd85fda9d8500793ba5f0c39fe94d6d7dc2624ca2bce94ffab76", "ja": "私、考えてみたんですけど。\nまだ、わからなくて……。", "zh": "我想了想，但还是……不太明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1068_001har", "source_sha256": "a411f0031123341082eca3044923ed69544c536d7ca3e96708aee9d4204174be", "ja": "だから……{$P$}さんが\nこの曲を選んだ理由が、知りたいんです。", "zh": "所以……我想知道，{$P$}先生选择这首歌的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1069_p", "source_sha256": "8d4d48e0288687339cf1ff377ca2ddb8157d7bf6ad48d41a2ac99dbaaa8fca65", "ja": "そうだな……。\n俺も、最初は別の曲を候補に考えていたんだけど……。", "zh": "是啊……我一开始也考虑过把另一首歌列为候选，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1070_p", "source_sha256": "8c05e7d2b74e5b55cfe79d351d38bd0873946e463e8e9ce2165b389c60ded19f", "ja": "でも、思ったんだ。この曲なら、春香の色んな\n魅力を繋げることができるんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "不过，我想了想。或许用这首歌，就能把春香的各种魅力串联起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1071_001har", "source_sha256": "238518ab4ccdacda466ec90c4409759fcb3839706fa18f76d85fc32108c4eb30", "ja": "え？　魅力を……繋げる、ですか？", "zh": "诶？把魅力……联系起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1072_p", "source_sha256": "2a6e68ad9203955de7d9230f82e4399582694e6988dce81cc1f767f613f1a811", "ja": "うん。普段の春香の魅力を見せたいなら、\n『春香らしい』と感じる曲は、他にもあると思う。", "zh": "嗯。如果想展现平时春香的魅力，\n我觉得应该还有其他让人感到“很有春香风格”的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1073_p", "source_sha256": "89ca803f3e487b3eff4049bac72a9b919227ad454ec41616ec52011765983a79", "ja": "でも、途中で気づいたんだ。それだけじゃ、\nもったいないのかもしれないって。", "zh": "不过，我在中途意识到，只是那样的话，或许太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1074_001har", "source_sha256": "3ffdb0bcb2aa6fb7d1fb9d7ec18ad3f14b583f51ce133a2250a9072d3ce8d229", "ja": "もったいない……。", "zh": "太可惜了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1075_p", "source_sha256": "a1060e31db5fe639a1bb97748bcfe5e3dc09658f164f2979d9461fd6c991b357", "ja": "例えばだけど。春香はいつも、仲間のみんなの事を\nよく見てるよな。今回の公演のレッスンでも、そうだ。", "zh": "比如说吧。春香总是很留意伙伴们的情况。就连这次公演的排练也是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1076_p", "source_sha256": "d51ddb071687e7553261bfc320d61c5bd2e067648edeea673498068bad905c70", "ja": "自分のセンター公演でも、どうしたら他の子の\n良いところが見せられるか、いつも気にかけてる。", "zh": "即使是自己的中心公演，也总是在意怎样才能展现其他孩子的优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1077_001har", "source_sha256": "11155e33f74c220307d7ab6d8310605d877bab11eb4414e91e9b7c993931bf13", "ja": "それは……えっと、そうした方が、最終的に\n良い公演になる気がする、っていうか……。", "zh": "那是……呃，我只是觉得，这样一来最后的公演会更精彩……或者说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1078_001har", "source_sha256": "c807cb1b8b98161ca6f7b89e30cf98b583ce91303d55b33cf29f23d0b9993920", "ja": "みんなが良い方が、いいなって思っちゃって。", "zh": "我觉得要是大家都能好好的，那就最好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1079_p", "source_sha256": "2c04348785c1d9f152236314c8ff040891fdb973e3be117ef72d100bb645932b", "ja": "そこが、春香のすごいところだよ。自然と\nそういう風に考えられるところ、っていうのかな。", "zh": "这就是春香厉害的地方。该说是能自然而然地\n这么想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1080_001har", "source_sha256": "c250d7466cab0109f68bd9487491ea95794a1e3815abf9cf4f2a94a481fbda97", "ja": "そ、そうでしょうか……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1081_p", "source_sha256": "c143bdcefde63a4f1504440c20c771cb6bc887367cf7d2bea6a2ec383a866799", "ja": "うん。……春香は、『I Want』を\n初めて聞いた時、どんな風に思った？", "zh": "嗯……春香第一次听到《I Want》的时候，是什么感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1082_001har", "source_sha256": "b4826512f4a94c2f1bf49e706f8008d76fdab7e28f0c509ec0ffca43e814735d", "ja": "私は……初めて聞いた時は、\nすごくビックリしました！", "zh": "我……第一次听到的时候，\n真的吓了一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1083_001har", "source_sha256": "24967aa8f3de0d13d4a62cf578ed1aba82372084d31dfd0b707d35c93ba4666f", "ja": "カッコイイ曲だったし、歌詞も刺激的で……\n正直、私に歌えるのかな？って。", "zh": "因为歌曲很帅气，歌词也很刺激……\n说实话，我当时还在想，自己真的能唱好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1084_p", "source_sha256": "29b8372fcaf4c7b9ee2213c961c274ae7645c0c56b3ff485d58596b519e588df", "ja": "うん、そうか。今はどうだ？", "zh": "嗯，是吗。现在感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1085_001har", "source_sha256": "1d1c3b62e381c7e4015f06f16ed5b7d3324baa60dee6c93471f3a28115b949e4", "ja": "今は……上手に歌えているかどうかは、\n自分ではわかりませんけど……。", "zh": "现在……我自己也不知道，唱得好不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1086_001har", "source_sha256": "4d4c14c905182e33a5a5d0cd3cab2581e338b8af24fa54ca6fc85e9ae42d02a0", "ja": "でもこの曲は、{$P$}さんや\n作曲家さん達が、私のために作ってくれた作品です。", "zh": "但是，这首歌是{$P$}先生和作曲家们为我创作的作品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1087_001har", "source_sha256": "63e0eaaff58b2bad100be0597e524473324ec15c01dfa04a61f3c2e4fee1b990", "ja": "だから、しっかり歌わなくちゃ、って思ってます。\n曲の世界を、伝えられるように。", "zh": "所以，我觉得自己一定要好好唱才行。\n要把歌曲的世界传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1088_p", "source_sha256": "88bd81013e112fc9bdc26625dd587e986af72da7e100ed3f8471121aa1c52622", "ja": "そうだな。どちらかというと、曲の方に、\n春香が自分を合わせていっている感じだと思う。", "zh": "是啊。真要说的话，我觉得更像是春香在逐渐让自己去适应歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1089_p", "source_sha256": "eb50ceb62ecde89df0b070fd18c633fc38d24056794df95b80233c21d840f281", "ja": "その表現力は、春香がこの前までやっていたような、\nお芝居に通じるんじゃないかって思ったんだ。", "zh": "我觉得，这种表现力或许和春香之前一直在演的戏剧，有相通之处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1090_001har", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1091_p", "source_sha256": "cce90d103ac596bff597f650df12c4d04c1cadf3fc9a3f4c5e08858b0a3ed6ae", "ja": "別人を演じているようなこの曲は、\n女優としての春香から、アイドルとしての春香を繋ぐ。", "zh": "这首仿佛在饰演另一个人的歌曲，\n连接起了作为女演员的春香与作为偶像的春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1092_p", "source_sha256": "441cbabaf66a8e491e8df8be591d73bb28e3c2f260d5a26e60f79bb3e6c79008", "ja": "『女優』として春香を知って、今回のステージを\n観に来てくれる人達に、はまる気がしたんだ。", "zh": "我觉得，这很适合那些因为了解作为『女演员』的春香，而来看这次舞台的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1093_001har", "source_sha256": "93a00bb3d716fd169efa59e54fada425122678315ded687dd1ab8d7efa8c1dd8", "ja": "それで、繋ぐ……。", "zh": "所以，把它们连接起来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1094_p", "source_sha256": "471d52119c7b1b032c34d62a05374ce38c73c552f4b5d4dd423acdf7dbcca0c5", "ja": "ああ。ステージでも演技でも、自分を見せる事を\n怖がらない。不器用でも、果敢に挑戦する……。", "zh": "啊。无论是在舞台上还是演戏时，都不要害怕展现自己。即使笨拙，也要勇敢地去挑战……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1095_p", "source_sha256": "067042d322582c4aa9dea2a864b052b2777466457cfc4c5cdcf7d41a71bf9ac3", "ja": "そんな春香だからこそ、できる事だと思うんだ。", "zh": "正因为是这样的春香，我才觉得你能做到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1097_p", "source_sha256": "dc5a84a3ecec6d957a260b78fe9054fe79bfc7a878bbacf83b0ca87b3fdfbc25", "ja": "みんなと歌う曲では、全体が良く見えるように\n気にする。それはチームなら、当然の事だけど……。", "zh": "和大家一起唱的歌曲，要注意让整体看起来更好。\n如果是一个团队，这也是理所当然的事，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1098_p", "source_sha256": "78050fcbdf1c04aa0d3a9cc658ec10916414f541333ed7ef10f4aaef82c0ae8e", "ja": "少なくとも、この曲の主役は春香だ。\nお客さんは春香しか見ていない。", "zh": "至少，这首歌的主角是春香。\n观众的目光全都在春香身上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1099_p", "source_sha256": "dd7a472132c6cda55231c6123653434b94eda88ec530cfc4ace74e478ded003c", "ja": "この曲で、春香の全部を見せよう！\nそれがお客さんの、一番見たいものだと俺は思う。", "zh": "就用这首歌展现春香的一切吧！\n我觉得，那就是客人最想看到的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1100_001har", "source_sha256": "0024a33fee24a1628c341157700fa7deed234eb29fe9c62d96c5ecd7c3cfc185", "ja": "私の、全部を……。", "zh": "我的全部……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1101_p", "source_sha256": "3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd", "ja": "ああ。", "zh": "嗯嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1102_001har", "source_sha256": "a415dfe8c080ba78300ce27c97e4e263fb6de9351bf5919c70fda61e1c0c62d8", "ja": "……どんな、歌であっても。\nそこにある本気は、伝わる……。", "zh": "……无论是什么样的歌。\n蕴含在其中的真心，都会传达给别人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1103_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1104_001har", "source_sha256": "84c46c882dbac00acb5a02bbd7cec075f6bd896149b8d167710582ee705f5e03", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんが、言ってたんです。……あの時は、\nどういうことか、よくわからなかったんですけど。", "zh": "琴叶说过……那时候，我还不太明白她是什么意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1105_001har", "source_sha256": "9443a8e6cfbfcf546383c2167a3d754ca6b2ee080a6aee20192e3c463c4cc259", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\n本気なら……それでいいんでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n只要是认真的……这样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1106_001har", "source_sha256": "e5e1dc98ea3af0e2c95f0a67491fc805228bd32e85a83bdffa1e2d42f167f89c", "ja": "それだけで、ぶつかってもいいですか？", "zh": "只凭这样，也可以勇敢面对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1107_p", "source_sha256": "5ebb0692c01dc742bdc03ab8714585a612c46bf4850c1dc7e5eb2441c96704ff", "ja": "もちろん。春香の、やりたいようにしてほしい。\n俺も、それを見たいと思うよ。", "zh": "当然。你想怎么做就怎么做吧，春香。\n我也想看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1108_001har", "source_sha256": "a0cc73f1d144950b406ac5c2e8e5fdf1d663eb97f256297461385463c89bfad9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1109_001har", "source_sha256": "50773400511cb7a58d47976a1d7c714bbc568d554cad0a75b989c41d5064b359", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、どうして\n『I Want』を選んだのか……わかりました。", "zh": "我明白了{$P$}先生为什么\n会选择《I Want》……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1110_001har", "source_sha256": "07895896e8bae03b09ab7af79d44488b74413b61600c2a488485593cd7bc3c2f", "ja": "私、挑戦してみようと思います。\n……どんな場所にいても、私は私ですから。", "zh": "我想试着挑战一下。\n……无论身处何地，我都是我自己嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1111_001har", "source_sha256": "d839bc238e1106d420dc5a6a143d4e8c582eb4dfd9977de9406e7c2227186e02", "ja": "いまの私を、全部ぶつけて……\n私のすべてを、みんなに見てもらえるように！", "zh": "倾注现在的我的一切……\n好让大家看到，完完整整的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1112_p", "source_sha256": "fdfc05eefcecf4bb0264f4c35617a1606c613e6aec49868a65c00e3fe43c716a", "ja": "春香なら、きっとやれる。応援してるよ。", "zh": "春香一定能做到的。我支持你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1113_001har", "source_sha256": "b66b4204b5b3a67aabe5a8427249fea8b5921d2305e199b4d66987ffc9ccdcdf", "ja": "{$P$}さん……えへへ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1114_p", "source_sha256": "fe4fa72ce04edcc2901fe8c664daa434fe38a96ebb95e26fdf21b365f430e87e", "ja": "今から、みんなの感想が楽しみだな。", "zh": "从现在开始，我就很期待大家的感想了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1115_001har", "source_sha256": "5908468a3bb2efb61ed29e696678c3b9052202877add81a8ff35f28fc496db31", "ja": "そうですね。感想……あっ！", "zh": "是啊。感想……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_100_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_100_1116_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
